+*   `HEADER_SIZE`: 44 bytes [S1, unofficial].
+*   `HEAD_PROBE`: `HEADER_SIZE + 8192` (8236 bytes). Size of the initial HTTP Range request to probe the header and directory [S1, unofficial].
 
